                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "possible _ i fixed this - this release. ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Issue i fixed was noexcept on Iteratable CTOR but some things which use that called Yield (like spinlock) - and that could occasionally throw – maybe fixed in v2.0a209",
